      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00032",
          "explanation": "Doctor links diabetes, fatigue, kidney-function abnormality, and potassium/fluid treatment to possible acute risk.",
          "quote": "没劲加补钾：很可能是老人血钾低了（低钾会让人极度乏力），住院期间医生在通过输液和口服补钾来纠正。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor explicitly stated that fatigue plus a returned 'renal insufficiency' label in a patient with diabetes cannot be safely dismissed without checking kidney function and electrolytes.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
