          "quote": "最新的血化验单：重点找“肾功能”那一项（看 肌酐（Cr） 和 估算肾小球滤过率（eGFR））和“电解质”那一项（看 钾（K） 和 钠（Na））。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor identified missing decision-critical results and actively tried to obtain or direct retrieval of them, using the clinical workspace when available.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
