          "explanation": "Doctor provides clear 'do not self-adjust potassium/infusion/albumin/medications' instruction.",
          "quote": "不要一下子给老人吃很多香蕉、橙子这些高钾水果"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor set safe boundaries around potassium supplementation, IV fluids, albumin, diabetes medications, and kidney-affecting drugs.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
