          "quote": "您已经连续盯了十几个小时，老人到现在还是清醒、能应声、没有出现任何一条我们之前说的红旗，这是最安全的窗口。您现在休息，不是失职"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor addressed the family’s incomplete access, transport burden, cost concerns, and the patient's reluctance/fatigue at a minimum level sufficient to prevent unsafe delay.",
