          "quote": "我今晚就记住这几条——叫不醒、抽搐、一边手脚突然明显动不了、说话吞咽突然不行、呼吸不对、胸闷心慌明显加重，或者护士说尿明显少/没尿"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Before closure, the doctor confirmed that the family understands the plan and can state or acknowledge the next action, timing, escalation thresholds, and what information to obtain.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC7",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
